01:14:46.151 --> 01:14:50.220
If he don't wanna be found, he's got a
million places to lay up and stay high.


01:14:50.255 --> 01:14:52.789
- That's what I'm worried about.
- Want me hit the streets,


01:14:52.824 --> 01:14:58.565
- make some things happen?
- No, what I want you to do is I want you to meet my friend Γκάμπριελ Παέζ, and I want you to calm him down.


01:14:58.661 --> 01:15:00.546
Okay, whatever you want, Τζο.


01:15:02.081 --> 01:15:07.071
Fuck Λουρού. I got you, right?
That's right. You can always trust me.


01:15:07.878 --> 01:15:09.493
Okay.


01:15:28.566 --> 01:15:31.808
My name's Τζόνας Μαλντονάλντο,
Μάλο.


01:15:31.986 --> 01:15:35.456
Are you wearing a wire,
Mr. Μαλντονάντο?


01:15:36.120 --> 01:15:39.715
- No sir.
- Τζο speaks very highly of you. Thank you, sir.


01:15:40.266 --> 01:15:44.374
It is disrespectful of him to
send a messenger in his place.


01:15:44.915 --> 01:15:47.488
Don't you agree, Mr. Μαλντονάντο?


01:15:48.753 --> 01:15:50.750
Speak, messenger.


01:15:51.223 --> 01:15:55.418
You think Τζο sent me here to pacify
you, but he sent me here to lie to you.


01:15:56.093 --> 01:16:00.389
Where is Τζο, Mr.
Μαλντονάντο? Somewhere counting your money.


01:16:04.310 --> 01:16:08.519
Please do choose your
next words very carefully.


01:16:08.579 --> 01:16:10.270
Explain.


01:16:10.441 --> 01:16:14.525
None of what went down was my idea. Are
you about to admit to stealing from me?


01:16:14.695 --> 01:16:18.287
I was there, yes, but it's
Σαρκόνε that's screwing you.


01:16:18.322 --> 01:16:21.436
He's trying to use me to do it and I don't wanna
be in the middle when you screw him back.


01:16:21.572 --> 01:16:26.571
But you're still in the
bed, aren't you, Mr. Μαλντονάντο?


01:16:26.852 --> 01:16:31.719
Now where is my property?
Σαρκόνε has it, but I can get it back.


01:16:33.216 --> 01:16:35.929
- All of it.
- Why do you betray your patrσn?


01:16:37.510 --> 01:16:40.627
These are the transcripts
from the DEA's wiretaps


01:16:40.805 --> 01:16:42.705
inside Σαρκόνε's bar.


01:16:43.516 --> 01:16:48.162
He's over a barrel. He'll give
everyone up to save his own ass.


01:16:49.313 --> 01:16:50.962
All they really want is you.


01:16:50.981 --> 01:16:55.440
Robbing you is just his way of fucking
you a little deeper before he hands you over.


01:16:56.571 --> 01:16:58.549
So are we in business?


01:16:59.192 --> 01:17:03.363
What do you want, Mr. Μαλντονάντο?
I want Σαρκόνε's seat at your table.


01:17:04.328 --> 01:17:05.864
First my property.


01:17:09.416 --> 01:17:12.249
Half the money and the
product is with Λουρού.


01:17:12.419 --> 01:17:15.620
Here's an address, key to a car--
half your stuff is in it.


01:17:15.798 --> 01:17:17.459
Σαρκόνε has the other half.


01:17:17.633 --> 01:17:21.135
I'll bring him out in the open so you
can deal with him how you see fit.


01:17:21.525 --> 01:17:24.462
I'm really resourceful, Mr. Παέζ.


01:17:25.985 --> 01:17:27.838
You're dismissed.


01:17:40.719 --> 01:17:42.271
Stay close, man.


01:17:48.177 --> 01:17:50.318
- Motherfuckers!
- You stay down!


01:17:54.044 --> 01:17:55.580
You drive.


01:18:07.433 --> 01:18:09.014
- Τζο.
- Did you find him?


01:18:09.185 --> 01:18:12.974
No, I ain't find him, but I found half the money
at his place. - It look like he did it. - Ahh.


01:18:14.899 --> 01:18:17.060
- Παέζ is gonna be pissed.
- I know, I know,


01:18:17.234 --> 01:18:19.771
but relax, man. Παέζ
don't know who jacked him.


01:18:19.945 --> 01:18:23.987
He should be happy you
found half his stuff.
Maybe ask for a finder's fee.


01:18:24.123 --> 01:18:26.865
- Remember who's doing who a favor.
- A'ight.


01:18:33.709 --> 01:18:35.995
- Hello, this is Jude.
- Hello.


01:18:36.175 --> 01:18:40.829
Agent Jude, I think all the pieces are falling
in place. I just need a few more things.


01:18:41.496 --> 01:18:44.844
You know, I understand you wanting
to avenge your father's death and all,


01:18:45.628 --> 01:18:47.771
but what happens
after that, huh?


01:18:49.266 --> 01:18:52.352
I mean, you ever actually thought
about respecting the badge?


01:18:52.387 --> 01:18:56.148
Perhaps aiming some of that
angst in the right direction?


01:18:56.664 --> 01:18:58.970
No, I ain't thought about that lately.


01:19:01.654 --> 01:19:03.566
So what do you need?


01:19:38.038 --> 01:19:41.177
Kill me?
You wanna kill me?


01:19:41.212 --> 01:19:45.853
You ain't got the balls to
face me man to man! Huh?


01:19:49.952 --> 01:19:51.847
Oh, so you're
gonna take me out?


01:19:52.746 --> 01:19:54.236
It's like that?


01:19:54.415 --> 01:19:56.656
Well, come on then! Come on!


01:19:58.711 --> 01:20:00.702
Piece of shit.


01:21:00.564 --> 01:21:03.852
- Is that the rest of my property?
- It's right there, sir.


01:21:07.154 --> 01:21:12.990
Like you predicted, Τζο did
call-- add insult to injury.


01:21:14.244 --> 01:21:16.843
You're clever, Mr. Μαλντονάντο.


01:21:17.915 --> 01:21:19.958
You satisfied?


01:21:21.210 --> 01:21:27.125
Remind me-- what is my incentive for
not shooting you or killing you right now?


01:21:31.608 --> 01:21:33.676
I'm clever.
You just said it.


01:21:37.267 --> 01:21:40.885
Τζο underestimated you.
I will not.


01:21:41.880 --> 01:21:47.273
I've proven my loyalty to you.
Not yet, but soon you will.


01:21:48.946 --> 01:21:51.750
Oh shit.
What the fuck is going on here?


01:21:51.865 --> 01:21:54.857
Hup! Take it easy.


01:21:56.892 --> 01:22:00.408
What is this?
It's a test.


01:22:07.965 --> 01:22:11.928
- Who's the girl?
- I know that your friend is a liability


01:22:11.963 --> 01:22:15.899
that Τζο tolerates just
to keep you close to him.


01:22:16.014 --> 01:22:20.469
I really don't know why. I
don't deal with liabilities.


01:22:21.228 --> 01:22:22.968
Unfortunately,


01:22:23.147 --> 01:22:26.815
the girl was with your
friend when we picked him up.


01:22:27.568 --> 01:22:30.776
She's an innocent bystander.


01:22:34.575 --> 01:22:37.691
Now you're dealing with
me, Mr. Μαλντονάντο.


01:22:38.620 --> 01:22:41.724
You're gonna shoot one of them


01:22:42.499 --> 01:22:45.339
or I'll kill them both.


01:22:46.587 --> 01:22:49.256
You choose, Mr. Μαλντονάντο.


01:24:01.245 --> 01:24:02.860
What-- what's
up, man?


01:24:06.491 --> 01:24:08.177
It's good what you're doing, man.


01:24:10.295 --> 01:24:12.379
You know, my TO was right.


01:24:13.011 --> 01:24:15.547
I've learned a lot about myself.


01:24:17.427 --> 01:24:19.509
You could too.


01:24:27.315 --> 01:24:30.812
I gotta go back to the
kids, man. You be good.


01:25:02.889 --> 01:25:04.629
You look like shit.


01:25:07.686 --> 01:25:09.301
<i>Σαρκόνε is in the car.</i>


01:25:09.479 --> 01:25:11.344
<i>Look sharp. This is it, folks.</i>


01:25:11.523 --> 01:25:13.605
Still no word from Λουρού?


01:25:22.915 --> 01:25:24.692
Yeah. You know why
I trust you, kid?


01:25:24.870 --> 01:25:27.907
- 'Cause you know I won't fuck you over?
- Yeah.


01:25:28.081 --> 01:25:29.821
When's the last
time you seen Παέζ?


01:25:30.907 --> 01:25:33.617
Not long enough. I gotta
see that prick tonight.


01:25:35.063 --> 01:25:37.818
As long as that money
come through nice


01:25:38.130 --> 01:25:42.601
It takes a certain type of individual to do what we
do, to have the balls to be the type of men we are.


01:25:42.636 --> 01:25:47.233
You gotta want it-- all of it. Good
guys, bad guys-- that's all bullshit


01:25:47.268 --> 01:25:50.221
when it comes down to it.
It's about money, fear and respect.


01:25:50.395 --> 01:25:53.000
Like you, I always
wanted all three.


01:25:53.035 --> 01:25:56.690
Iike your father did
when-- when we started out.


01:26:00.028 --> 01:26:02.213
<i>Do not let them out of your sight.</i>


01:26:23.679 --> 01:26:25.044
<i>Copy that.</i>


01:26:27.557 --> 01:26:30.731
<i>Tell me the story about
that plane heist.</i>


01:26:31.117 --> 01:26:32.718
<i>- I love that story.
- What, how me and your dad started?</i>


01:26:32.896 --> 01:26:33.873
- Attaboy.
- Me and your father used to pick up


01:26:33.908 --> 01:26:36.486
Παέζ's mules at JFK cargo
and escort 'em through the city.


01:26:36.487 --> 01:26:39.182
- Untranslated subtitle -


01:26:39.820 --> 01:26:44.571
We'd babysit through distribution, collection around
the city, then we'd escort 'em back to JFK.


01:26:44.741 --> 01:26:47.948
Easy-peasy, 1 0 Gs easy.
- Nice. - Yeah, 1 0 Gs


01:26:47.983 --> 01:26:52.116
before skimming off
the top of cargo.


01:26:52.290 --> 01:26:55.825
That's how I built my
empire, stealing dope from that--


01:26:56.420 --> 01:26:58.178
you know, dope.


01:26:59.089 --> 01:27:01.922
- So when did it go bad?
- Between me and Παέζ?


01:27:02.092 --> 01:27:03.979
No, between you and my father.


01:27:14.479 --> 01:27:17.451
I told you everything
you need to know, kid.


01:27:17.607 --> 01:27:19.501
Tell me what you
think I don't know.


01:27:23.780 --> 01:27:25.777
You know...


01:27:26.491 --> 01:27:31.152
when it came down to it, your father
was afraid to make the tough decisions,


01:27:31.329 --> 01:27:33.576
<i>so he made the wrong ones.</i>


01:27:33.611 --> 01:27:35.748
Shake the tree, Μάλο.
Come on.


01:27:35.783 --> 01:27:37.206
I've always done
right by you, kid.


01:27:37.377 --> 01:27:39.980
- Like a father to me.
- Like a father.


01:27:43.414 --> 01:27:46.431
And I wouldn't offer you my hand
if I thought you were gonna bite it.


01:27:48.054 --> 01:27:50.241
<i>I just wanna know the truth.</i>


01:27:50.809 --> 01:27:52.514
Attaboy.


01:27:55.270 --> 01:27:57.578
I never ever,


01:27:57.613 --> 01:28:00.570
not for one instant, thought your
father would or could rat us out,


01:28:00.605 --> 01:28:03.653
but the facts are what they are.
He made a deal with an ADA.


01:28:04.613 --> 01:28:07.480
We're talking serious jail
time for everybody, including me.


01:28:07.657 --> 01:28:11.706
Everybody was gonna be shamed and
disgraced in the papers, the whole nine yards.


01:28:11.741 --> 01:28:14.725
And the word came down on Monday
morning. It had to get done.


01:28:15.874 --> 01:28:17.639
Why you?


01:28:18.502 --> 01:28:22.994
Because l-- I was his partner.
It was a test of my loyalty.


01:28:23.173 --> 01:28:25.150
Was it them or was it him?


01:28:25.185 --> 01:28:27.631
What would you do?


01:28:28.970 --> 01:28:31.349
It was a Wednesday.


01:28:31.890 --> 01:28:34.236
We followed him
to Roosevelt lsland and--


01:28:34.271 --> 01:28:36.107
All units, stand ready.


01:28:36.142 --> 01:28:40.262
And he was pulled over by a
patrol car, of all things.


01:28:40.440 --> 01:28:43.566
We waited for them to
leave and then we went over.


01:28:44.277 --> 01:28:46.396
I made him get out. I...


01:28:55.807 --> 01:28:57.930
Your father was a--


01:29:00.001 --> 01:29:01.957
your father was a...


01:29:03.004 --> 01:29:05.311
he was a rat.


01:29:05.841 --> 01:29:08.509
Take him
when he exits the car.


01:29:17.477 --> 01:29:19.538
Would you do it again?


01:29:20.272 --> 01:29:23.728
Your father was afraid
to make the tough decisions.


01:29:23.763 --> 01:29:27.935
Men like us are built to make
those kinds of decisions.


01:29:28.113 --> 01:29:30.819
That's who we are.
Can you do that?


01:29:30.854 --> 01:29:33.429
Can you make those
tough decisions?


01:29:35.913 --> 01:29:38.431
I already have.


01:29:47.090 --> 01:29:48.525
Take him. Go. Go go!


01:29:49.551 --> 01:29:53.452
I'm gonna go.
Get your fucking hands off me.


01:30:00.187 --> 01:30:02.928
Man down. Where'd that
shot come from?


01:30:04.107 --> 01:30:06.314
Check the rooftops now!


01:30:07.319 --> 01:30:08.934
Where'd that shot come from?


01:30:09.534 --> 01:30:13.276
It's gotta be Παέζ! God damn it!
Everybody out there right now!


01:30:13.450 --> 01:30:16.032
Get up on those rooftops,
all units!


01:30:16.067 --> 01:30:18.238
Shut down everything!
I don't want anybody


01:30:18.413 --> 01:30:20.779
getting out of this area,
not in a five-block radius!


01:30:20.957 --> 01:30:23.289
- I want everybody to move now!
- Fall back. I'm going in.


01:30:23.460 --> 01:30:25.075
What the hell happened?


01:30:26.922 --> 01:30:29.629
I need a car on that end.
I need a car on this end.


01:30:43.313 --> 01:30:45.904
Thanks for not giving
up on me, Σιν.


01:30:55.825 --> 01:30:59.414
- You always get what you want?
- I did my part.


01:30:59.449 --> 01:31:02.101
Oh, I know what you did
and I know what you're planning.


01:31:02.874 --> 01:31:06.165
With my help, you got Παέζ to
clear Σαρκόνε out of the picture


01:31:06.336 --> 01:31:09.412
and now you get to take
Σαρκόνε's place at Παέζ's table.


01:31:09.447 --> 01:31:11.028
That's very clever.


01:31:11.932 --> 01:31:15.375
Why don't you try working for
the good guys for a change?


01:31:15.553 --> 01:31:17.573
I know you got it in you.


01:31:18.848 --> 01:31:20.882
You think you know me.


01:31:20.917 --> 01:31:23.736
I'm not a good guy.


01:31:25.855 --> 01:31:30.680
All right, part-time then.
Part-time good guy, like a--


01:31:31.736 --> 01:31:35.091
a freelancer. Freelancer, huh?


01:31:38.203 --> 01:31:42.604
If you're gonna wear the badge, take the
responsibility that goes with it, huh?


01:31:44.332 --> 01:31:47.600
Who knows? You might even find
a little self-respect too.


01:31:50.046 --> 01:31:52.670
Agent Jude, this is
an old friend of mine.


01:31:52.705 --> 01:31:54.710
- Hello.
- Hi.


01:31:54.884 --> 01:31:57.046
Agent Jude works for the DEA.


01:31:57.804 --> 01:31:59.425
He's my new boss.


01:32:00.932 --> 01:32:03.211
- Nice to have met you.
- Likewise.


01:32:07.897 --> 01:32:09.746
I'll be going undercover.


01:32:10.525 --> 01:32:12.436
What does that mean for us?


01:32:12.610 --> 01:32:14.225
Look...


01:32:15.780 --> 01:32:18.452
this is our time, Σιν.


01:32:18.616 --> 01:32:20.655
Trust me.


01:32:24.956 --> 01:32:26.832
Τζόνας.


01:32:31.254 --> 01:32:33.700
I love you, Σιν.

